'''Attack on W-Cyclone (Expert)''' is the third [[:Category:Cyclone Stages|Cyclone Stage]]. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.3 Update|Version 2.2.3]] and appears every Friday. Upon completion, the player has a 40% chance to unlock [[Rope Jump Cat (Rare Cat)|Rope Jump Cat]].

