==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 5.33~16.67 seconds<sup>160f~500f</sup>.
*7 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 1.33~4 seconds<sup>40f~120f</sup>.
*3 [[Duche]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 3.33~3.67 seconds<sup>100f~110f</sup>.
*15 [[Duche]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 20~33.33 seconds<sup>600f~1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[THE SLOTH]] spawns after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn after 100 seconds<sup>3,000f</sup>, delay 33.33~46.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,400f</sup>.
*3 [[Dagshund]]s spawn after 90 seconds<sup>2,700f</sup>, delay 0.67~0.73 seconds<sup>20f~22f</sup>.
*3 [[Dagshund]]s spawn after 73.33 seconds<sup>2,200f</sup>, delay 0.67~0.73 seconds<sup>20f~22f</sup>.
*1 [[White Cyclone]] spawns as the boss after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**3 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 80% HP:
**3 [[Otta-smack-u]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.

==Strategy==
White Cyclone is slightly harder than the [[Red Cyclone]] and the [[Dark Cyclone]] due to having one less trait. The fact that it's backed up by Duche, Dagshund, Otta-Smack-U and THE SLOTH doesn't help. Use all the [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating cats]] you have and avoid letting them walk into the range of THE SLOTH, who can easily wipe them out. If you have [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]], you can cheese the stage by destroying the enemy base before White Cyclone even spawns.

Do not bring any [[:Category:Cats with Knockback ability|Cats with knockback abilities]] against [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]]. Any anti-floating stacks will risk pushing into the range of THE SLOTH and dying very quickly.

